message: "If you use AITM-SMB, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "AITM-SMB: AI Transformation Methodology for Small and Medium-Sized Businesses"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Duchenchuk
    given-names: Alex
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-28
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Moai-Team-LLC/agentic-product-standard"
url: "https://github.com/Moai-Team-LLC/agentic-product-standard/tree/main/aitm-smb"
abstract: >-
  AITM-SMB is an open, domain-neutral, agent-readable methodology for the AI
  transformation of small and medium-sized businesses. Its unit of
  transformation is the Business Capability, not the AI use case: every change
  traces from a measurable business Outcome through diagnosed Gaps and Causes to
  Interventions, Initiatives, Metrics, and Evidence. AI is optional (four of
  eighteen intervention families); its authority is granted explicitly at
  human decision gates, bounded, observable, and reducible.
keywords:
  - AI transformation
  - small and medium-sized businesses
  - business capability
  - methodology
  - human oversight
  - AI governance
  - agent skills
